我希望在 Pop Up 里可以有一个开关和两个列表，分别代码：

1. 使用官方双字幕（bool 型开关）
2. 官方源字幕语言列表、官方目标字幕语言列表，这样，比如源选韩语、目标选中文的话，你在获取了两种字幕数据后（需要用户点击netflix菜单选择对应的字幕语言），在两种语言数据都已获取之后，在界面上有所提示，然后在 Panel 中就可以显示所有的字幕时间轴数据。

Implemented in v1.50. Files touched: =manifest.json=, =src/content/config.js=,
=src/content/netflix/subtitle-api.js=, =src/content/translator.js=,
=src/content/main.js=, =popup.html=, =popup.js=.

- Added "使用官方双字幕" toggle in popup to enable official bilingual subtitles
- Added two dropdowns that dynamically populate with available Netflix subtitle languages
- Status indicators show how many cues have been captured for each selected language
- When both languages are selected and user enables them in Netflix's subtitle menu,
  all timeline data is automatically loaded into the panel
- Source language subtitles are used as originals, target language as translations
- When official subtitles are enabled, Google Translate is bypassed completely
- Real-time updates as Netflix loads more cues during playback
- Official subtitles are marked with ✓ badge and green border in the panel

Usage:
1. Click "使用官方双字幕" checkbox in popup
2. Select source language (e.g. Korean) and target language (e.g. Chinese)
3. In Netflix player menu, select the source subtitle language first, wait a moment
4. Then select the target subtitle language, wait a moment
5. The panel will populate with all available bilingual subtitles automatically

